  "title": {
   "en": "Nibante no Onna - Utahime to shite no Hokori wo Mune ni, Saigo no Gohoukou wo Itashimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "二番手の女　歌姫としての誇りを胸に、最後のご奉公をいたします"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Songstress’s Last Devotion"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Arietti once dreamed of reaching the highest honor a songstress could attain—the title of \"Miko-Hime,\" the Sacred Diva. But when her name is not called, her dream quietly shatters.\n\nSoon after, she’s offered a prestigious marriage arrangement with the powerful Marquess of Carving, Joshua… only for it to be abruptly called off before it even begins.\n\nHumiliated and disheartened, Arietti thinks things couldn’t get worse—until she’s ordered to serve as a priestess envoy to none other than Carving itself.\n\nNow, sent to a remote land tied to her public disgrace, Arietti must carry herself with dignity, confront her past, and discover a new strength beyond the stage.",
   "ja": "アリエッティは、歌姫の頂点「巫女姫」を目指すも、あえなく落選。そして、カービング辺境伯・ヨシュアとの縁談がくるも、いきなり破談。散々な目にあったアリエッティだったが、さらにカービングに神官としての派遣を命じられてしまうのだった…！？"
  },
